    "question": "Anika has 4 more than twice the number of pencils as Reeta. If Reeta has 20 pencils, how many pencils do the two have together?",
    "gold": "64",
    "answer": "If Reeta has 20 pencils, then twice that number is 2*20 = 40 pencils.\nAnika has 4 more than twice the number of pencils as Reeta, which means she has 40+4 = 44 pencils.\nTogether, the two have 44+20 = <<44+20=64>>64 pencils\n#### 64"
