  "generation": {
    "text": "To determine the total number of pencils Anika and Reeta have together, we need to follow these steps:\n\n1. Identify the number of pencils Reeta has.\n2. Use the information given to find out how many pencils Anika has.\n3. Add the number of pencils Anika has to the number of pencils Reeta has to get the total.\n\nStep 1: Reeta has 20 pencils.\nStep 2: Anika has 4 more than twice the number of pencils as Reeta. First, we calculate twice the number of pencils Reeta has:\n\\[ 2 \\times 20 = 40 \\]\nNext, we add 4 to this amount to find out how many pencils Anika has:\n\\[ 40 + 4 = 44 \\]\nStep 3: Add the number of pencils Anika has to the number of pencils Reeta has to get the total:\n\\[ 20 + 44 = 64 \\]\n\nTherefore, the total number of pencils Anika and Reeta have together is \\(\\boxed{64}\\).",
